<article class="mv-decision" data-ask="decisions.yaml#fleet-cost-1" data-hash="587902cda8d8c68e" data-kind="decision">
<p class="mv-dmeta bv-meta">
<span class="mv-chip" data-kind="decision">decision</span> decisions.yaml · asked 2026-10-17T12:00:00Z by <bdi>claude:coordinator</bdi>
</p>
<p class="mv-dtitle">Context-cost policy: compact at 300K, rotate orchestrators, both, or wait?</p>
<p class="mv-stakes">devteam ran out twice this week; context length is the lever.</p>
<p class="mv-callout" data-tone="warning">If you don't answer: wait: nothing changes and spend continues</p>
<p class="mv-gates bv-meta">Blocks <span class="bv-code">fleet-cost</span>
</p>
<p class="mv-dbody">Long sessions drive the fleet's cost: about 19% of sessions over 400K context carry about 87% of it. Rotating long orchestrators by handoff caps the biggest spenders and leaves workers alone.</p>
<p class="mv-dbody">Which context-cost policy should the fleet run?</p>
<p class="mv-dbody mv-why">Why you: It trades quality on long workers for spend, which is your call.</p>
<h3 class="mv-label bv-meta">Choose one</h3>
<ol class="mv-dopts">
<li class="mv-dopt" data-option="rotate" data-recommended="true" data-chosen="false">
<p class="mv-dopt-label">Rotate long orchestrators by handoff</p>
<p class="mv-dopt-text">Orchestrators roll over at a set context size; workers are untouched.</p>
<p class="mv-chips">
<span class="mv-badge" data-tone="info">Recommended</span>
<span class="mv-badge" data-tone="success">Reversible</span>
</p>
<dl class="mv-cells">
<div class="mv-cell">
<dt class="bv-meta">Cost</dt>
<dd>Saves on long orchestrators only</dd>
</div>
<div class="mv-cell">
<dt class="bv-meta">Risk</dt>
<dd>Workers untouched</dd>
</div>
<div class="mv-cell">
<dt class="bv-meta">Undo</dt>
<dd>Stop rotating</dd>
</div>
</dl>
</li>
<li class="mv-dopt" data-option="both" data-recommended="false" data-chosen="false">
<p class="mv-dopt-label">Both: rotate, plus 300K compaction</p>
<p class="mv-dopt-text">Lower cost and some quality risk on long workers.</p>
<p class="mv-chips">
<span class="mv-badge" data-tone="success">Reversible</span>
</p>
<dl class="mv-cells">
<div class="mv-cell">
<dt class="bv-meta">Cost</dt>
<dd>Saves more</dd>
</div>
<div class="mv-cell">
<dt class="bv-meta">Risk</dt>
<dd>Some quality risk on long workers</dd>
</div>
<div class="mv-cell">
<dt class="bv-meta">Undo</dt>
<dd>Turn compaction off</dd>
</div>
</dl>
</li>
<li class="mv-dopt" data-option="wait" data-recommended="false" data-chosen="false">
<p class="mv-dopt-label">Re-measure in a week</p>
<p class="mv-dopt-text">No change.</p>
<p class="mv-chips">
<span class="mv-badge" data-tone="success">Reversible</span>
<span class="mv-badge">Status quo</span>
</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 class="mv-label bv-meta">Tradeoffs</h3>
<ul class="mv-free">
<li>
<p class="mv-dopt-label">Measuring first</p>
<dl class="mv-cells">
<div class="mv-cell">
<dt class="bv-meta">Time</dt>
<dd>One week</dd>
</div>
</dl>
</li>
</ul>
